================

=> To change file/directory ownership we use `chown` command

# Change owner

sudo chown new-owner file/directory

# Change group

sudo chown :new-group file/directory

# Change owner and group

sudo chown new-owner:new-group file/directory

# Change ownership recursively

sudo chown -R new-owner:new-group directory

